{'symbol': 'SYF', 'date': '2023-04-27 09:00:00', 'title': "SYNCHRONY JOINS OPERATION HOPE'S NATIONAL 'FINANCIAL LITERACY FOR ALL' INITIATIVE", 'text': "ADVANCES ACCESS TO YOUTH AND ADULTS WITH FINANCIAL EDUCATION PARTNERSHIP REINFORCES SYNCHRONY'S COMMITMENT TO EDUCATION AS AN EQUALIZER STAMFORD, CONN. , APRIL 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SYNCHRONY (NYSE: SYF), A PREMIER CONSUMER FINANCIAL SERVICES COMPANY,\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BECOME A MEMBER COMPANY OF FINANCIAL LITERACY FOR ALL (FL4ALL)\xa0– A NATIONAL INITIATIVE DEDICATED TO EMBEDDING FINANCIAL LITERACY INTO AMERICAN CULTURE."}